@startuml
hide empty description
[*] --> PENDING : Order created by checkout
PENDING --> CONFIRMED : OrderService.confirm
PENDING --> CANCELLED : cancel / cancelByCustomer
CONFIRMED --> SHIPPING : startDelivery
SHIPPING --> DELIVERED : markDelivered
DELIVERED --> COMPLETED : confirmReceipt by owner
COMPLETED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of CONFIRMED
  BANKING confirmation requires a PENDING
  transaction, PENDING order, and BANKING
  payment. It sets the order to CONFIRMED.
end note

note bottom of CANCELLED
  Cancellation accepts PENDING only and restores
  inventory. Pending BANKING payment becomes FAILED;
  pending transactions become REJECTED.
end note
@enduml
